@startuml Sequence Diagram - Kelola Pengguna
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Sequence Diagram - Kelola Pengguna\nSistem Prediksi Penyebaran DBD

actor Admin
participant Browser
participant "Flask App\n(users.py)" as flask
participant "User Model" as user_model
participant "LogAktivitas\nModel" as log_model
database "Database\n(MySQL)" as db

== Scenario 1: Melihat Daftar Pengguna ==

Admin -> Browser : 1.1: GET /users/
Browser -> flask : 1.2: SELECT * FROM users
flask -> db : 1.2: SELECT * FROM users
db --> flask : 1.3: return list users
flask --> Browser : 1.4: Tampilkan tabel users
Browser --> Admin : 1.4: Tampilkan tabel users

== Scenario 2: Tambah Pengguna Baru ==

Browser -> flask : 2.1: Submit form (POST /users/create)
note left of flask : Note: Password di-hash\nmenggunakan werkzeug
flask -> flask : 2.2: generate_password_hash()
note left of flask : Note: Semua aktivitas\ndicatat di log_aktivitas
flask -> user_model : 2.3: INSERT INTO users
user_model -> db : 2.4: db.session.add() & commit()
flask -> log_model : 2.5: log('Membuat user baru')
log_model -> db : 2.6: INSERT INTO log_aktivitas
flask --> Browser : 2.7: flash('Pengguna berhasil ditambahkan')

== Scenario 3: Hapus Pengguna ==

Browser -> flask : 3.1: POST /users/delete/<id>
note left of flask : Note: Admin tidak bisa\nmenghapus akunnya sendiri
flask -> flask : 3.2: if user.id == current_user.id

alt [Self Delete]
    flask --> Browser : 3.3: flash('Tidak dapat menghapus akun sendiri')
end

@enduml
